  "description": "This eBike, with a 72V 50Ah dual-controller system, delivers up to 100Ah for smooth starts, strong climbs, and easy handling on all terrain. If one controller fails, the other takes over seamlessly. The dual-layer aluminum sine-wave controllers ensure efficient heat dissipation and reliable performance.\n\nOur air fork, uniquely designed for dual-motor high-speed eBikes, is one-of-a-kind. The advanced air suspension fork, with adjustable rebound and 110 mm travel, delivers exceptional damping. The spring-based rear shock absorbs rough terrain impacts, ensuring a smoother ride over rugged trails.\n\nThe eBike’s premium 20-inch all-terrain tires deliver unrivaled grip and stability, conquering rugged trails and slick surfaces with ease. Featuring high-traction rubber, they ensure smooth, durable performance, empowering thrill-seekers to tackle any outdoor adventure with confidence.",
